WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:07.620
I would get in my car in the morning, gas it up, and I would go the bus route.

2
00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:11.180
The bus went down East Boulevard and went uptown then hit North Boulevard and up.

3
00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:13.600
There was a Sears store on the corner there.

4
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.740
I would go the bus route and stop.

5
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:17.480
People be on the corners.

6
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:22.920
Get the car loaded and go on up and then come on back out in South Baton Rouge.
